{"id":"torrey:clouds","source":"torrey","name":"Clouds","slug":"clouds","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Formed from the sea — 1Ki 18:44; Am 9:6.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,44,18,44],["Amos",9,6,9,6]]},{"text":"Are garment of the sea — Job 38:9.","refs":[["Job",38,9,38,9]]},{"text":"Established. — Pr 8:28.","refs":[["Prov",8,28,8,28]]},{"text":"Balanced in the air. — Job 37:16.","refs":[["Job",37,16,37,16]]},{"text":"Disposed in order. — Job 37:15.","refs":[["Job",37,15,37,15]]},{"text":"Brings over the earth. — Ge 9:14.","refs":[["Gen",9,14,9,14]]},{"text":"Binds up. — Job 26:8.","refs":[["Job",26,8,26,8]]},{"text":"Spreads out. — Job 26:9.","refs":[["Job",26,9,26,9]]},{"text":"Scatters. — Job 37:11.","refs":[["Job",37,11,37,11]]},{"text":"Power and wisdom of God exhibited in forming — Ps 135:6,7; 147:5,8; Jer 10:13; 51:16.","refs":[["Ps",135,6,135,6],["Ps",135,7,135,7],["Ps",147,5,147,5],["Ps",147,8,147,8],["Jer",10,13,10,13],["Jer",51,16,51,16]]},{"text":"Power and wisdom of God exhibited in condensing — Job 36:27,28; 37:10,11; Pr 3:20.","refs":[["Job",36,27,36,27],["Job",36,28,36,28],["Job",37,10,37,10],["Job",37,11,37,11],["Prov",3,20,3,20]]},{"text":"Made for the glory of God — Ps 148:4.","refs":[["Ps",148,4,148,4]]},{"text":"Clouds of heaven. — Da 7:13; Mt 24:30.","refs":[["Dan",7,13,7,13],["Matt",24,30,24,30]]},{"text":"Windows of heaven. — Ge 7:11; Isa 24:18.","refs":[["Gen",7,11,7,11],["Isa",24,18,24,18]]},{"text":"Bottles of heaven. — Job 38:37.","refs":[["Job",38,37,38,37]]},{"text":"Chambers of God. — Ps 104:3,13.","refs":[["Ps",104,3,104,3],["Ps",104,13,104,13]]},{"text":"Waters above the firmament. — Ge 1:7.","refs":[["Gen",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Dust of God’s feet. — Na 1:3.","refs":[["Nah",1,3,1,3]]},{"text":"White. — Re 14:14.","refs":[["Rev",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Bright. — Job 37:11; Zec 10:1.","refs":[["Job",37,11,37,11],["Zech",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Thick. — Job 22:14; 37:11.","refs":[["Job",22,14,22,14],["Job",37,11,37,11]]},{"text":"Black. — 1Ki 18:45.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,45,18,45]]},{"text":"Swift. — Isa 19:1.","refs":[["Isa",19,1,19,1]]},{"text":"Great. — Eze 1:4.","refs":[["Ezek",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Small. — 1Ki 18:44.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,44,18,44]]},{"text":"Often cover the heavens — Ps 147:8.","refs":[["Ps",147,8,147,8]]},{"text":"Often obscure the sun, &c — Job 36:32; Eze 32:7.","refs":[["Job",36,32,36,32],["Ezek",32,7,32,7]]},{"text":"Often dispersed by the wind — Ho 13:3.","refs":[["Hos",13,3,13,3]]},{"text":"To give rain. — Jdj 5:4; Ps 104:13,14.","refs":[["Judg",5,4,5,4],["Ps",104,13,104,13],["Ps",104,14,104,14]]},{"text":"To supply dew. — Pr 3:20; Isa 18:4.","refs":[["Prov",3,20,3,20],["Isa",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"To moderate heat. — Isa 25:5.","refs":[["Isa",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"From the west, bring rain — Lu 12:54.","refs":[["Luke",12,54,12,54]]},{"text":"Though small, often bring much rain — 1Ki 18:44,45.","refs":[["1Kgs",18,44,18,44],["1Kgs",18,45,18,45]]},{"text":"Thunder and lightning come from — Ps 77:17,18.","refs":[["Ps",77,17,77,17],["Ps",77,18,77,18]]},{"text":"The rainbow appears in — Ge 9:13,14.","refs":[["Gen",9,13,9,13],["Gen",9,14,9,14]]},{"text":"Frequently the instrument of God’s judgments — Ge 7:11,12; Job 37:13; Ps 77:17.","refs":[["Gen",7,11,7,11],["Gen",7,12,7,12],["Job",37,13,37,13],["Ps",77,17,77,17]]},{"text":"Ignorant of the spreading of. — Job 36:29.","refs":[["Job",36,29,36,29]]},{"text":"Ignorant of the disposing of. — Job 37:15.","refs":[["Job",37,15,37,15]]},{"text":"Ignorant of the balancing of. — Job 37:16.","refs":[["Job",37,16,37,16]]},{"text":"Cannot number. — Job 38:37.","refs":[["Job",38,37,38,37]]},{"text":"Cannot cause to rain. — Job 38:34.","refs":[["Job",38,34,38,34]]},{"text":"Cannot stay. — Job 38:37.","refs":[["Job",38,37,38,37]]},{"text":"Of multitudes of persons. — Isa 60:8; Heb 12:1.","refs":[["Isa",60,8,60,8],["Heb",12,1,12,1]]},{"text":"Of hostile armies. — Jer 4:13; Eze 38:9,16.","refs":[["Jer",4,13,4,13],["Ezek",38,9,38,9],["Ezek",38,16,38,16]]},{"te